  <p>
    This is the section most "nursing scope" pages soften, because it does not make for a good admissions pitch.
    It is also one of the single most useful things to understand before you commit years and real fees to this
    path — because it is a structural fact about Indian hospital nursing, not a story about one weak hospital.
  </p>

  <div class="comparison-grid">
